{"at": "2026-11-25T09:46:34.460Z", "run": "20261125-0137-verify-debrid-5636", "unit": "u19", "op": "set", "rid": "debrid/real-debrid", "path": "$.reliability_note", "old": "The published whitelist has been withdrawn while the mechanism it describes has not. On 2026-08-29 the archived /vpn page carried a 113-row table of non-cooperative VPN providers with an allowed-address count for each; on 2026-10-20 the same page carried neither that table nor any cooperative rows, and two live reads today render the cooperative header with zero rows. The 403 shell on /trafficshare is served as HTTP 200, so a probe reports usable=true on a page that says only '403 - Forbidden'.", "new": "The /vpn page publishes a table of VPN names with an allowed-address count for each, from 143VPN at 51 to Zscaler at 32768; the earlier withdrawal of that table is reversed. An account-gated page returns a shell whose body says the request was refused.", "rung": "documented", "evidence": {"url": "https://real-debrid.com/vpn", "date": "2026-11-25", "proved": "the live /vpn page publishes a non-cooperative VPN table with an allowed-address count per provider", "capture": "sha256:1bae5aaf0c5d8fd7f9b302b6f715e8524e4f32b0ddf460563e2a38fb8c8073f4", "quote": "| Zscaler | 32768 |"}, "added": true, "reason": "the VPN allowance table is published again, reversing the earlier 'withdrawn' state"}
